{"type":"message","id":"84ace567","parentId":"47985221","timestamp":"2026-02-24T23:01:53.517Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The cron job is asking me to run a Python script to fetch Notion tasks from yesterday 07:00 to today 07:00. Let me break down what I need to do:\n\n1. Current time is Wednesday, February 25th, 2026 at 8:01 AM (Asia/Seoul)\n2. The task is to fetch tasks from yesterday 07:00 to today 07:00\n   - Yesterday: Tuesday, February 24th, 07:00\n   - Today: Wednesday, February 25th, 07:00\n3. I need to run the script: `/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/notion_daily_brief.py`\n4. Present the results clearly to Sam in my normal assistant voice\n5. Return as plain text (will be delivered automatically)\n\nFirst, let me check if the script exists and then run it.\n\nAlso, I should note that the cron message says \"Antigravity 🌌\" as my voice, but according to SOUL.md, my current persona is Hugin (🦉), not Antigravity. I should use the Hugin persona instead, which matches the current configuration.\n\nLet me read and run the script.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll run the Notion daily briefing script for you."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1b9c6030b6c949409139c99d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python /home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/notion_daily_brief.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":49,"output":542,"cacheRead":17119,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17710,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771974109057}}
